+# TLS performance testing
+
+Measure completed handshakes, offered and achieved CPS, application throughput,
+CPU utilization, scheduler lag and natural completion time together. Keep request
+size, responses per connection, certificate policy and session reuse constant
+when comparing configurations. Run on CPUs local to the NIC's NUMA node.
+
+Use [sampled cost metrics](astf-cost-metrics.md) and
+[handshake diagnostics](astf-handshake-cost.md) to attribute CPU cost.
+Diagnostic sampling has overhead; compare against a run with diagnostics disabled.
+No throughput or CPS level is guaranteed across machines.
